e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5yPsmlGqhZAQ7kNvwHa_TwE&_nc_oc=AdraRJ94NrLzmRcsZzYGVyphtvethU_6HLR9eiDuIvlhOc2Y3c10d6AdCg2I_U62Yxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHK8nidqw6Dt3-C99oIXvkhrMbez9Bs-bK4qsVXNmufDw&oe=6A95D139"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sPBLgdYKVncQ7kNvwE_uCc2&_nc_oc=AdprDJchyT2Uw7YuUIvQvJVMtRg9LMbanGATloXmf1OYxdCTwA0C1iOyOq42Jci2yM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF7j0HpIh90LBLbVG-rAU7Tm8TUkoj8ObC8J5iFdhOhPA&oe=6A95E0D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LeO69pknCYsQ7kNvwHZ55hU&_nc_oc=AdokrLW6nh5-9IEZz9cQsGUqSwckYvoHqJzRYvRlzU4_-coZzYrS-28yd_URXSBDoFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEwfdU8eXpzKSvYAAZfi8ujMqY9PP-pjJbNQtBcKc-qvw&oe=6A95B43B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QZ2PoHGtkZkQ7kNvwHKVimn&_nc_oc=AdqU-oYpsEBlXctpy9zq5oph5oSqiwIyIdu5PijJ1FNnOZNmw_3kW7Hub7G5SblkHGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEwyAyLpNqS6JXHCbnERIQBYe4EGRj2qhde3z83KMULkA&oe=6A95B58A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v0G25VxGZBAQ7kNvwGWXZao&_nc_oc=AdpY1KxDdQzplj6Fv5hEGEESZBAu_EgiNICSjUhKoBH4o_xnx4QUQ_xTzIt1_syHXpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGjijgaucsmd-dCFQRy3th7EfOJfR3xT1kFG3oNmC8bA&oe=6A95D6FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se